Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.24,Hdr,,0,0,0,,December 25, 1988 - Arima Kinen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Round the final turn and into the straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:04.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Hawaiian Coral just in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.10,0:00:05.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Running Free improving on the inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.70,0:00:09.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,And out wide, two greys are closing in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:12.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Oguri Cap and Tamamo Cross come up together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:15.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Up the hill now - a showdown of the greys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:17.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Behind them, Soccer Boy on the far outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:19.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Super Creek bursts through the gap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:23.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Up front - Oguri Cap's determination or Tamamo Cross's class?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:26.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Side by side - Oguri Cap just edges ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:32.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Oguri Cap wins it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:35.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,At the third time of asking, Oguri Cap gets his revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:38.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,He's finally beaten Tamamo Cross!